<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">  <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">  <head>  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1" />  <title>Monster</title>  </head>    <body>  <table width="600" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">  <tr>  <td width="17"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//corner_2_1.gif" width="17" height="16" /></td>  <td style="border-top:solid 1px #bfbfbf;"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//trans.gif" width="1" height="1" /></td>  <td width="17"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//corner_2_2.gif" width="17" height="16" /></td>  </tr>    <tr>  <td style="border-left:solid 1px #bfbfbf;">&nbsp;</td>  <td><table width="95%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">    <tr>  <td height="40"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI/header.jpg" width="550" height="364" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">Right Resume</td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br /><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//1.jpg" width="200" height="195" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" />A good resume lays the foundation of a good job opportunity. So get your right resume today!<br />  <br /><strong>How it Works:</strong><br />  <br />  Our resume experts evaluate your resume and other information including your strengths, weaknesses, certifications earned etc. Based on the  same, we write you an exceptional professional resume with the capability to generate results. Our expert writers specialize in different career verticals. So no matter which industry you belong to or what is your experience, you get a resume that stands out!<br />  <br /><strong>What You Get:</strong><br />  <br />  <ul>    <li>Clearly stated objective targeting the job you're looking for</li>    <li>Work history in a chronological order</li>    <li>Highlights of your educational background</li>    <li>Focus on your professional skills and significant achievements</li>    <li>Draft sentences in a way that it grabs the attraction of potential employers</li>    <li>Usage of Job specific keywords that get you noticed</li>    <li>Use of industry Terminology matching your job requirements</li>    <li>Appealing formatting</li>  </ul>  <br />    <table width="95%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">  <tr>  <td width="50%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Price List</strong></td>  <td width="50%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Entry Level</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 749</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>New Professionals</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 1599</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Mid Career</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 2399</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Senior Management</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 3199</strong></td>  </tr>  </table>  <br />  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">XpressResume+</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br /><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//2.jpg" width="199" height="134" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" /><strong>Share your resume with <br />  TOP PLACEMENT COMPANIES <br />  <br />  </strong><strong>How It Works </strong><br />  Under Xpress Resume+, we send your resume to over 1200 consultwho hire ants in India and 200 in the Gulf across all industry verticals for jobs located in India. Since our professional resume writers know what employers are looking for, they customize your resume for a new look and feel that makes you stand <br /> apart grom the crowd.<br />  <br />  <strong>What You Get:</strong><br />  <br />  <ul>    <li>Xpress Resume+ makes your resume accessible to non paid recruiter base of Monster.com for 180 days.</li>    <li> Xpress Resume+ also makes your CV accessible, exclusively (via a dedicated link to the Xpress resume bank) to entire paid recruiter base of Monster.com for 90 days without any additional charge. After 90 days, your CV remains a part of the regular database.</li>    <li> You get to know how many recruiters have viewed your resume</li>    <li> We guarantee your data confidentiality.</li>  </ul>  There are no hidden charges.<br />  <br />    <table width="95%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">  <tr>  <td width="57%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Price List</strong></td>  <td width="43%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Xpresss Resume+ (Single City) <br />  </strong>Bangalore, Chennai, Delhi, Hyderabad, Mumbai</td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 599</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>All India Consultants(1200Consultants)</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 999</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Gulf Region(200 consultants)</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 1499</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>All India + Gulf(1400 consultants)</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 1999</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Singapore Region(100+ Consultants)</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 249</strong></td>  </tr>  </table><br /></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">Career Booster+</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br /><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//3.jpg" width="200" height="142" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" /><strong>Leverage the power of both Right Resume and Xpress Resume+ in one go!<br />  <br />  How It Works</strong><br />  <br />  Under CareerBooster, we not only write a professional resume for you but also circulate it among top placement consultants across India and Gulf.<br />  <br />  Our resume experts make your resume serve as the most efficient sales tool that promotes you as the most deserving candidate. So no matter which industry you belong to or what is your experience, you get a resume that stands out! Finally yet importantly, your  newly written professional resume is then shared with top consultants across India and / or Gulf.<br />  <br /><strong>What You Get:</strong><br />  <br />  <ul>    <li>Clearly stated objective targeting the job you're looking for</li>    <li>Work history in a chronological order</li>    <li> Highlights of your educational background</li>    <li> Focus on your professional skills and significant achievements</li>    <li> Draft sentences in a way that it grabs the attraction of potential employers</li>    <li> Usage of Job specific keywords that get you noticed</li>    <li> Use of industry Terminology matching your job requirements</li>    <li> Appealing formatting</li>    <li> With Xpress Resume+, make your CV accessible, exclusively (via a dedicated link to the Xpress resume bank) to entire paid recruiter base of Monster.com for 90 days without any additional charge. After 90 days, your CV remains a part of the regular database.</li>  </ul><strong>And now save on 10% on Career Booster for more details please click on the below link:</strong> <a href="http://careerbooster.monsterindia.com/index.html" target="_blank">http://careerbooster.monsterindia.com/index.html</a><br />&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">Resume Highlighter</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br /><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//4.jpg" width="200" height="166" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" /><strong>Gain better visibility among employers with our Resume   Highlighter.</strong><br />  <br />  Resume Highlighter gives you a competitive edge you need to be noticed by potential employers. When employers search for resumes on Monster India, Monster Gulf and Monster Singapore a search result listing comes up. It has the summary of all relevant resumes according to the requirement and preferences filled in by the employers. This is where your resume highlighter helps you by making your resume stand out! <br /> <br />Resume highlighter gives your resume as eye catching look and pave ways<br />for your brighter job opportunities.<br />  <br />    <table width="95%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">  <tr>  <td width="57%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Price List</strong></td>  <td width="43%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>India Region</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 499</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Gulf  Region</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>USD 49</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Singpaore Region</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>SGD 69</strong></td>  </tr>  </table>  <br />  &nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">VSkills &ndash; Test Your Skills, Own Your Future</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br /><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//5.jpg" width="200" height="201" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" />Vskills helps you earn a professional certification without undergoing any formal training or classroom teaching and opens ways for new career opportunities. <br />  <br />  Vskills is a &quot;skills testing&quot; and certification exam by - ICSIL, a JV of TCIL, A Govt of India Undertaking and DSIIDC, A Govt of NCT Delhi Undertaking. ICSIL is one of the largest manpower companies of the government of Delhi.<br />  <br /><strong>How It Works</strong><br />  <ol>    <li>Visit our website (http://www.monsterindia.com). Browse through our 'Career Services'.</li>    <li>Click on Vskills Certifications and choose your industry and the certification suitable for your career.</li>    <li>Fill in your details and choose the nearest examination centre among our Test Centres. </li>    <li> You can order and pay online using our secure online ordering system. Once<br />      you confirm your details and order, you will receive an invoice in your mail.</li>    <li> Next, your admit card and study material will be delivered to your address of<br />      correspondence.<br />    </li>    <li> Prepare for the exam.<br />    </li>    <li> Appear for the examination with admit card.<br />    </li>    <li>Get the certification.</li>  </ol><strong>Advantages At A Glance</strong><br />  <ul>    <li>A Vskills certificate serves as an impartial endorsement of your professional knowledge in your resume.</li>    <li> It adds value to your professional skills and makes them more sellable, enabling you to package yourself for success. </li>    <li>It offers you an opportunity to be certified in areas where you are not formally educated. </li>    <li>It opens multiple avenues in various industrial sectors, paving ways for brighter career opportunities.</li>    <li>It does not require any time commitment since there is no classroom teaching involved. It's just a test.</li>  </ul><strong><br />  What's More</strong> CVs of certified professionals are flagged on Monster India (http://www.monsterindia.com) as 'Vskills Certified Candidates' and are shared  with top employers.<br />&nbsp; </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td height="40" bgcolor="#683997" style="padding-left:10px; font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:#FFF">Psychometric Tests</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td align="left" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><br />  <img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//6.jpg" width="200" height="200" hspace="15" vspace="10" align="right" />With a majority of employers using aptitude tests as a critical part of their recruitment process, you must ensure that you are well prepared. They serve as the tool to assess candidates on behavioral dimensions.<br />  <br />  Monster in collaboration with Central Test brings you scientifically validated psychometric tools to help you get an insight into your personality &amp; career. Central Test is a leading provider of online tests and objective assessments with offices in London, Paris and Hyderabad. <br />  <br />  With our online psychometric tests, you can determine your areas of improvement and can see how well you perform. Monster India offers a comprehensive selection of psychometric tests designed for:<br />  <br />  <table width="95%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">  <tr>  <td width="57%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Managers</strong></td>  <td width="43%" style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 411 approx</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>Sales and Marketing Professionals</strong></td>  <td style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size:12px;"><strong>INR 317 approx</strong></td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td><strong>For All Professionals</strong></td>  <td><strong>INR 227 approx</strong></td>  </tr>  </table></td>  </tr>  </table></td>  <td style="border-right:solid 1px #bfbfbf;">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style="border-left:solid 1px #bfbfbf;">&nbsp;</td>  <td><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//ftr.jpg" width="550" height="61" /></td>  <td style="border-right:solid 1px #bfbfbf;">&nbsp;</td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td valign="bottom"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//corner_2_3.gif" width="17" height="16" /></td>  <td style="border-bottom:solid 1px #bfbfbf;"><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//trans.gif" width="1" height="1" /></td>  <td><strong><img src="http://media.monsterindia.com/promotions/250912_RightResume_MI//corner_2_4.gif" width="17" height="16" /></strong></td>  </tr>  </table>  </body>  </html>